31:["$","p","p-11",{"children":["通过这个实操，你实际上已经跑通了",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"异构数据同步"}],"的最核心路径。"]}]
32:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"ROW 格式的威力：代码里的 oldRow 和 newRow 之所以能拿到，全靠 MySQL Binlog 的 ROW 格式记录了镜像数据。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"准实时性：当敲下 SQL 回车的一瞬间，Go 程序几乎同时输出了日志。这就是 Binlog 推送的效率（通常在 10ms 以内），足以满足绝大多数最终一致性的业务需求。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"解耦：在操作 MySQL 时，完全不需要知道 Redis 的存在。是 Go 程序作为\"旁路\"把数据搬运过去的。这就实现了业务代码与缓存逻辑的解耦。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
33:["$","p","p-12",{"children":"在刚才的 Demo 中，我跳过 Kafka 是为了降低学习门槛和演示环境复杂度（避免让你在本地搭建 Zookeeper + Kafka 集群）。"}]
34:["$","p","p-13",{"children":["但在",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"真实的生产环境（高并发/大规模）中，引入 Kafka（或 RocketMQ）几乎是必须的"}],"。"]}]
35:["$","p","p-14",{"children":["我们来深度剖析一下：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"为什么在这个链路中，我们需要 Kafka 做中间件？"}]," 它到底解决了什么\"直连模式\"解决不了的问题？"]}]
36:["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"强耦合"}],"：Go 程序既要负责解析 Binlog（复杂的协议），又要负责写 Redis（业务逻辑）。如果 Redis 挂了，或者 Redis 写得太慢，会阻塞 Binlog 的解析，导致",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"主从延迟堆积"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"无法复用"}],"：如果你的搜索团队说：\"嘿，我也想要一份用户余额变更的数据写到 Elasticsearch 里\"。你就得改代码，或者再起一个 Binlog 监听（对 MySQL 造成双倍压力）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"无削峰能力"}],"：如果 MySQL 瞬间爆发 10 万 TPS 的写入，Go 程序会尝试向 Redis 发起 10 万次写入，Redis 可能会直接崩掉（缓存雪崩）。"]}],"\n"]}]
37:["$","p","p-15",{"children":"这个时候我们可以引入类似 Kafka 这样的消息队列，那架构就变成了："}]
38:["$","p","p-16",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"MySQL -> Binlog 解析器 (Canal/Debezium) -> Kafka -> 消费者 (Go App) -> Redis"}]}]
39:["$","p","p-17",{"children":["在这个架构中，",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Kafka"}]," 扮演了最重要的\"缓冲\"和\"解耦\"角色。"]}]
3a:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"6-kafka-在-cdc-链路中的四大核心价值","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#6-kafka-在-cdc-链路中的四大核心价值","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#6-kafka-在-cdc-链路中的四大核心价值"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6. Kafka 在 CDC 链路中的四大核心价值","position":{"start":{"line":299,"column":5,"offset":6334},"end":{"line":299,"column":30,"offset":6359}}}]},"children":"6. Kafka 在 CDC 链路中的四大核心价值"}]}]
3b:["$","h4","h4-2",{"id":"61-解耦","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#61-解耦","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#61-解耦"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.1 解耦","position":{"start":{"line":301,"column":6,"offset":6366},"end":{"line":301,"column":12,"offset":6372}}}]},"children":"6.1 解耦"}]}]
3c:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Binlog 解析器 (Producer)"}],"：只负责把 Binlog 变成 JSON 扔进 Kafka。它根本不关心下游是 Redis 还是 ES，也不关心下游是不是挂了。它的任务就是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"快"}],"，紧跟 MySQL 主库。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"业务消费者 (Consumer)"}],"：只负责从 Kafka 拿消息写 Redis。如果 Redis 挂了，消费者可以暂停，Kafka 会帮我们保存进度（Offset）。等 Redis 修好了，消费者重启，继续从断点消费。",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"整个过程不影响 MySQL 主库。"}]]}],"\n"]}]
3d:["$","h4","h4-3",{"id":"62-削峰填谷","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#62-削峰填谷","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#62-削峰填谷"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.2 削峰填谷","position":{"start":{"line":306,"column":6,"offset":6632},"end":{"line":306,"column":14,"offset":6640}}}]},"children":"6.2 削峰填谷"}]}]
3e:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"场景"}],"：大促期间，MySQL 瞬间涌入 5 万 QPS 的充值请求。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"作用"}],"：Kafka 极其能抗写（百万级 TPS）。它能瞬间吞下这 5 万条消息，像一个巨大的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"蓄水池"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"下游"}],"：后端的 Go 程序可以按照自己的节奏（比如每秒处理 2000 个），慢慢地从 Kafka 里取数据更新 Redis。Redis 此时是非常安全的，不会被流量洪峰打死。"]}],"\n"]}]
3f:["$","h4","h4-4",{"id":"63-广播多路分发","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#63-广播多路分发","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#63-广播多路分发"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.3 广播/多路分发","position":{"start":{"line":312,"column":6,"offset":6841},"end":{"line":312,"column":17,"offset":6852}}}]},"children":"6.3 广播/多路分发"}]}]
40:["$","ul","ul-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"场景"}],"：一份数据，多处使用。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"作用"}],"：Binlog 数据进入 Kafka 的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Topic: user_balance_update"}]," 后：\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Consumer Group A (缓存组)"}],"：读取数据 -> 更新 Redis。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Consumer Group B (搜索组)"}],"：读取同一份数据 -> 更新 Elasticsearch。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Consumer Group C (数仓组)"}],"：读取同一份数据 -> 存入 Hive/ClickHouse。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"收益"}],"：MySQL 只需要承受一次 Binlog Dump 的压力，实现了",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"一次生产，多次消费"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}]
41:["$","h4","h4-5",{"id":"64-数据回放","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#64-数据回放","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#64-数据回放"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.4 数据回放","position":{"start":{"line":321,"column":6,"offset":7169},"end":{"line":321,"column":14,"offset":7177}}}]},"children":"6.4 数据回放"}]}]
42:["$","ul","ul-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"场景"}],"：你写的更新 Redis 的代码有个 Bug，把余额加错了。代码上线跑了 1 个小时你才发现。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"作用"}],"：如果是直连模式，Binlog 早就流过去了，难以重来。但在 Kafka 模式下，你可以把消费者的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Offset (偏移量)"}]," 重置到 1 小时前。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"结果"}],"：消费者会重新拉取过去 1 小时的历史消息，重新计算并覆盖 Redis 中的错误数据。"]}],"\n"]}]
